       "fr": "Voici le même message de trois façons. Décontracté : « Hey, can’t make it tomorrow, sorry! Rain check? » Professionnel : « Hi Mark, unfortunately I won’t be able to make tomorrow’s meeting. Could we reschedule for Thursday? » Formel : « Dear Mr. Thompson, I regret to inform you that I will be unable to attend tomorrow’s meeting. I would be grateful if we could reschedule at your earliest convenience. » Tous corrects, mais des relations très différentes.",
