       "en": "Watch out for things that **come off as** rude in writing: ALL CAPS (= shouting), a one-word reply (“Ok.”), no greeting at all, too many question marks (“Why??”), or “Please do this ASAP.” with nothing else. Add a greeting, a softener, and a thank-you: “Hi Sam! Would you be able to send this today? We’re a little tight on time. Thanks so much!”",
