       "en": "And then there’s **polite fiction**: things everyone says without meaning them literally. “We should get together sometime!”, “Let’s grab coffee one of these days!”, “Come by anytime!”. They mean “I like you” and “I feel friendly”. Don’t be hurt if no plan follows. If *you* want a real plan, make it concrete: “I’d love that! Are you free next Saturday?” That turns fiction into reality.",
