     "model": "(1) I think she means it’s not a priority right now, and she isn’t convinced yet. It’s not a yes, but it’s not a final no either.\n\n(2) Hi Karen, thanks so much for taking a look at my proposal. I completely understand that the holidays are busy. In the meantime, would it help if I put together some numbers on how many patients have asked for evening appointments? I’m happy to keep it short. Thanks again!\nBest,\nClaire\n\n(3) Aw, thanks for thinking of me! Unfortunately, I’m going to pass this time, it’s been a long week. I hope you have an amazing time, and I want to hear all about it on Monday!"
